{"_help":"Named looks for ai-social-studio clips. Each theme bundles a karaoke caption style, caption colours, the hook-box colours, the progress bar and watermark hints. Use with edit_clip(theme='name') or the CLIP_THEME env var. The 'clean' theme is the current default look (white hook box, black text, no progress bar) — picking no theme changes nothing. Hex colours without '#'. A theme never sets the watermark text (that is the streamer's Kick bar).","themes":[{"caption_style":"hormozi","colors":{"key":"5CFF3D","outline":"000000","spoken":"FFE500","text":"FFFFFF"},"hook_box":"FFFFFF","hook_text":"0A0A0A","label":"Clean (neutral default)","name":"clean","progress":false,"progress_color":"FFE500","watermark_color":"FFFFFF","watermark_opacity":0.6,"watermark_pos":"tl","watermark_size":0.2},{"caption_style":"hormozi","colors":{"key":"FF3B30","outline":"000000","spoken":"FFE500","text":"FFFFFF"},"hook_box":"FFE500","hook_text":"000000","label":"Bold yellow (Hormozi punch)","name":"bold-yellow","progress":true,"progress_color":"FFE500","watermark_color":"FFE500","watermark_opacity":0.8,"watermark_pos":"tl","watermark_size":0.22},{"caption_style":"hormozi","colors":{"key":"FF2E93","outline":"164E63","spoken":"22D3EE","text":"FFFFFF"},"hook_box":"7C1D6F","hook_text":"FFFFFF","label":"Neon (cyan and magenta glow)","name":"neon","progress":true,"progress_color":"22D3EE","watermark_color":"22D3EE","watermark_opacity":0.8,"watermark_pos":"tr","watermark_size":0.2},{"caption_style":"minimal","colors":{"key":"FFFFFF","outline":"000000","spoken":"FFFFFF","text":"FFFFFF"},"hook_box":"1A1A1A","hook_text":"FFFFFF","label":"Minimal white (quiet, thin)","name":"minimal-white","progress":false,"progress_color":"FFFFFF","watermark_color":"FFFFFF","watermark_opacity":0.5,"watermark_pos":"br","watermark_size":0.16},{"caption_style":"hormozi","colors":{"key":"2F6BFF","outline":"0B0F1A","spoken":"2F6BFF","text":"FFF6E3"},"hook_box":"0B0F1A","hook_text":"FFF6E3","label":"Warm ink (cream te